pbwinput 1
# Phase 5 story checkpoint: the SHA-pinned catch save continued through Alder on Route 19, his first
# Floccesy Town conversation and the upstairs Town Map / Route 20 instruction, then east to Route 20.
# The real field scripts are res/field/scripts/route_19.s and floccesy_town.s; their event rectangles are in
# res/field/events. The finished save is zone 446 at grid (130,661), with event work 40a3=2 and 40a5=2.
# oracle.py sequence floccesy compares every frame through 31900, before SAVE; round-trip floccesy plays
# SAVE through frame 34600 and checks the data and fresh-process continuations. Counts are game frames
# (sVBlankCount). The clock is pinned; each seed is one captured from the DS running these inputs.
# White 2: the lower grass fence blocks the eastward path. Two genuine encounters, Patrat and
# Purrloin, are escaped with the RUN touch at (128,160); released taps and B advance their messages.
# The northward step at 9400 avoids the girl on row 697. Both battle seeds are the DS values.
